# Guardian Engine — environment variables
#
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored (never commit real keys).
# Only the backend AI proxy (apps/backend/ai) reads these — the mobile/client
# side never sees the API key, by design (Privacy by Design, ADR-003 spirit).

# ── AI proxy (apps/backend/ai/AnthropicUpstream.ts) ────────────────────────
# Required. The proxy refuses to start without it (AnthropicUpstream throws).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Optional. Defaults shown. Override only if you have a reason.
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com
# ANTHROPIC_API_VERSION=2023-06-01

# ── Notes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model allow-list is NOT an env var — it's hardcoded server-side in
# apps/backend/ai/contract.ts (ALLOWED_MODELS) on purpose, so a compromised
# client cannot route traffic to an unlisted/expensive model. Current list:
#   claude-haiku-4-5, claude-sonnet-5, claude-opus-4-8
# Verify these strings against https://docs.claude.com before production —
# model identifiers change and a stale string fails at runtime.
